<title>PORTUGAL: BPI pays 2,615 esc p/share BFE.</title>
<headline>BPI pays 2,615 esc p/share BFE.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Portugues de Investimento (BPI) offered 2,615 escudos per share in its successful bid for state-controlled Banco de Fomento e Exterior (BFE), the Lisbon bourse said.</p>
<p>The government announced last Thursday that BPI had won the competitive bidding process for the 65 percent of BFE on offer.</p>
<p>Shares in BFE were suspended last week at 2,545 escudos.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon editorial +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
